#. TRANSLATORS: Checkbox label in the Linux setup dialog, offering to make the `pb`
#. command-line tool (Paperback's headless document-to-text/HTML converter) runnable
#. from a shell. Mirrors the Windows installer's "Add Paperback directory to PATH" task.
msgid "Add the pb command-line tool to PATH"
msgstr "Додати інструмент командного рядка pb до змінної PATH"

#. TRANSLATORS: Checkbox label in the Linux file-association setup dialog. Shared by
#. multiple parsers (DAISY, Word-in-zip), so it's kept as its own opt-in entry rather
#. than tied to one format, same as the Windows installer's "assoc_zip" task.
msgid "ZIP Archives (.zip)"
msgstr "Архіви ZIP (.zip)"

#. TRANSLATORS: Announced when OCR can't run because the system has no OCR language installed
msgid "No OCR language is installed. Add one in your system language settings."
msgstr ""
"Мова для OCR не встановлена. Додайте її в налаштуваннях мови вашої системи."

#. TRANSLATORS: Announced when the OCR engine fails on a page
msgid "OCR failed."
msgstr "Помилка розпізнавання."

#. TRANSLATORS: Announced when OCR is requested on a system that has no OCR engine
msgid "OCR is not available on this system."
msgstr "У цій системі функція OCR недоступна."

#. TRANSLATORS: Error message shown when another app instance's IPC pipe already exists and a new one can't be created
msgid "Failed to create IPC server"
msgstr "Не вдалося створити сервер IPC"

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a warning dialog
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Попередження"

#. TRANSLATORS: Announced when trying to play/pause audio on a document that has none
#. TRANSLATORS: Announced when trying to seek audio on a document that has none
#. TRANSLATORS: Announced when trying to change audio playback speed on a document that has none
msgid "This document has no audio."
msgstr "У цьому документі немає аудіо."

#. TRANSLATORS: Announced when trying to seek audio before playback has established a position
msgid "Audio hasn't started playing yet."
msgstr "Відтворення аудіо ще не розпочалося."

#. TRANSLATORS: Announced when the audio speed is already at its fastest; {} is the current speed, e.g. "2x"
#. TRANSLATORS: Announced when the audio seek amount is already at its largest preset; {} is the current amount, e.g. "1 hour"
msgid "{} (maximum)"
msgstr "{} (максимум)"

#. TRANSLATORS: Announced when the audio speed is already at its slowest; {} is the current speed, e.g. "0.5x"
#. TRANSLATORS: Announced when the audio seek amount is already at its smallest preset; {} is the current amount, e.g. "5 seconds"
msgid "{} (minimum)"
msgstr "{} (мінімум)"

#. TRANSLATORS: Audio seek amount, announced after changing it via keyboard shortcut
#. TRANSLATORS: Audio seek amount option, shown in the audio seek amount dropdown
msgid "5 seconds"
msgstr "5 секунд"

#. TRANSLATORS: Audio seek amount, announced after changing it via keyboard shortcut
#. TRANSLATORS: Audio seek amount option, shown in the audio seek amount dropdown
msgid "10 seconds"
msgstr "10 секунд"

#. TRANSLATORS: Audio seek amount, announced after changing it via keyboard shortcut
#. TRANSLATORS: Audio seek amount option, shown in the audio seek amount dropdown
msgid "30 seconds"
msgstr "30 секунд"

#. TRANSLATORS: Audio seek amount, announced after changing it via keyboard shortcut
#. TRANSLATORS: Audio seek amount option, shown in the audio seek amount dropdown
msgid "1 minute"
msgstr "1 хвилина"

#. TRANSLATORS: Audio seek amount, announced after changing it via keyboard shortcut
#. TRANSLATORS: Audio seek amount option, shown in the audio seek amount dropdown
msgid "2 minutes"
msgstr "2 хвилини"

#. TRANSLATORS: Audio seek amount, announced after changing it via keyboard shortcut
#. TRANSLATORS: Audio seek amount option, shown in the audio seek amount dropdown
msgid "5 minutes"
msgstr "5 хвилин"

#. TRANSLATORS: Audio seek amount, announced after changing it via keyboard shortcut
#. TRANSLATORS: Audio seek amount option, shown in the audio seek amount dropdown
msgid "10 minutes"
msgstr "10 хвилин"

#. TRANSLATORS: Audio seek amount, announced after changing it via keyboard shortcut
#. TRANSLATORS: Audio seek amount option, shown in the audio seek amount dropdown
msgid "30 minutes"
msgstr "30 хвилин"

#. TRANSLATORS: Audio seek amount, announced after changing it via keyboard shortcut
#. TRANSLATORS: Audio seek amount option, shown in the audio seek amount dropdown
msgid "1 hour"
msgstr "1 година"

#. TRANSLATORS: Prefix announced when navigation wraps around past the end/start of the document; the trailing space is significant
msgid "Wrapping to start. "
msgstr "Перехід на початок. "

msgid "Wrapping to end. "
msgstr "Перехід в кінець. "

#. TRANSLATORS: Announcement when landing on a bookmark; %s is the bookmark/line text, %d is the bookmark's 1-based index
msgid "%s - Bookmark %d"
msgstr "%s — Закладка %d"

#. TRANSLATORS: Announced when there are no bookmarks/notes at all to navigate to
msgid "No notes."
msgstr "Нотаток немає."

msgid "No bookmarks."
msgstr "Закладок немає."

#. TRANSLATORS: Announced when there is no next bookmark/note from the current position
msgid "No next note."
msgstr "Наступної нотатки немає."

msgid "No next bookmark."
msgstr "Наступної закладки немає."

#. TRANSLATORS: Announced when there is no previous note from the current position
msgid "No previous note."
msgstr "Попередньої нотатки немає."

#. TRANSLATORS: Announced when there is no previous bookmark from the current position
msgid "No previous bookmark."
msgstr "Попередньої закладки немає."

#. TRANSLATORS: Fallback announcement when viewing a bookmark that has no note text or line snippet
msgid "Bookmark."
msgstr "Закладка."

#. TRANSLATORS: Announced after toggling a bookmark at the current selection off/on
msgid "Bookmark removed."
msgstr "Закладку видалено."

msgid "Bookmark added."
msgstr "Закладку додано."

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of the dialog for adding or editing a bookmark note
#. TRANSLATORS: Title of the Bookmark Note editor dialog
msgid "Bookmark Note"
msgstr "Нотатка до закладки"

#. TRANSLATORS: Prompt label in the bookmark note dialog asking the user to type their note
msgid "Enter bookmark note:"
msgstr "Введіть нотатку до закладки:"

#. TRANSLATORS: Announced after saving a bookmark's note text
msgid "Bookmark saved."
msgstr "Закладку збережено."

#. TRANSLATORS: Message shown when trying to view a bookmark note but the current position has none
msgid "No note at the current position."
msgstr "У поточній позиції нотатки немає."

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of the View Note dialog
msgid "View Note"
msgstr "Перегляд нотатки"

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of the file picker dialog shown when opening a document
msgid "Open Document"
msgstr "Відкрити документ"

#. TRANSLATORS: Announced when clearing the Recent Documents list while it is already empty
#. TRANSLATORS: Announced when opening "All Documents" while the recent-documents list is empty
msgid "No recent documents."
msgstr "Немає останніх документів."

#. TRANSLATORS: Announced after the Recent Documents list has been emptied
msgid "Recent documents cleared."
msgstr "Останні документи очищено."

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the File menu to open a document.
msgid "&Open..."
msgstr "&Відкрити..."

#. TRANSLATORS: Status-bar help text for the File > Open menu item.
msgid "Open a document"
msgstr "Відкрити документ"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the File menu to close the current document.
msgid "&Close"
msgstr "&Закрити"

#. TRANSLATORS: Status-bar help text for the File > Close menu item.
msgid "Close the current document"
msgstr "Закрити поточний документ"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the File menu to close all open documents.
msgid "Close &All"
msgstr "Закрити &Усі"

#. TRANSLATORS: Status-bar help text for the File > Close All menu item.
msgid "Close all documents"
msgstr "Закрити всі документи"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the File menu to reopen the most recently closed document.
msgid "Reopen &Last Closed"
msgstr "Відкрити &останній закритий файл"

#. TRANSLATORS: Status-bar help text for the File > Reopen Last Closed menu item.
msgid "Reopen the last closed document"
msgstr "Відкрити останній закритий документ"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the File > Recent Documents submenu to empty the recent documents list.
msgid "Clea&r Recent Documents"
msgstr "О&чистити останні документи"

#. TRANSLATORS: Status-bar help text for the File > Recent Documents > Clear Recent Documents menu item.
msgid "Remove all documents from the Recent Documents list"
msgstr "Видалити всі документи зі списку останніх документів"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the File menu to exit the application, shown only on Windows and Linux since macOS provides its own Quit menu item.
#. TRANSLATORS: System tray menu item to quit the application
msgid "E&xit"
msgstr "&Вийти"

#. TRANSLATORS: Status-bar help text for the File > Exit menu item.
msgid "Exit the application"
msgstr "Вийти з програми"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the previous section of the document.
#. TRANSLATORS: Name of this keyboard-shortcut action, shown in the Customize Keyboard Shortcuts dialog (its list of assignable actions, and the "Set Shortcut for {}" / conflict-reassignment prompts).
msgid "Previous Section"
msgstr "Попередній розділ"

#. TRANSLATORS: Status-bar help text for the Go > Previous Section menu item.
msgid "Go to previous section"
msgstr "Перейти до попереднього розділу"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the next section of the document.
#. TRANSLATORS: Name of this keyboard-shortcut action, shown in the Customize Keyboard Shortcuts dialog (its list of assignable actions, and the "Set Shortcut for {}" / conflict-reassignment prompts).
msgid "Next Section"
msgstr "Наступний розділ"

#. TRANSLATORS: Status-bar help text for the Go > Next Section menu item.
msgid "Go to next section"
msgstr "Перейти до наступного розділу"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the previous heading of any level in the document.
msgid "&Previous Heading"
msgstr "&Попередній заголовок"

#. TRANSLATORS: Status-bar help text for the Go > Previous Heading menu item.
msgid "Go to previous heading"
msgstr "Перейти до попереднього заголовка"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the next heading of any level in the document.
msgid "&Next Heading"
msgstr "&Наступний заголовок"

#. TRANSLATORS: Status-bar help text for the Go > Next Heading menu item.
msgid "Go to next heading"
msgstr "Перейти до наступного заголовка"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the previous level-1 heading in the document.
msgid "Previous Heading Level &1"
msgstr "Попередній заголовок рівня &1"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the next level-1 heading in the document.
#. TRANSLATORS: Name of this keyboard-shortcut action, shown in the Customize Keyboard Shortcuts dialog (its list of assignable actions, and the "Set Shortcut for {}" / conflict-reassignment prompts).
msgid "Next Heading Level 1"
msgstr "Наступний заголовок рівня 1"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the previous level-2 heading in the document.
msgid "Previous Heading Level &2"
msgstr "Попередній заголовок рівня &2"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the next level-2 heading in the document.
#. TRANSLATORS: Name of this keyboard-shortcut action, shown in the Customize Keyboard Shortcuts dialog (its list of assignable actions, and the "Set Shortcut for {}" / conflict-reassignment prompts).
msgid "Next Heading Level 2"
msgstr "Наступний заголовок рівня 2"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the previous level-3 heading in the document.
msgid "Previous Heading Level &3"
msgstr "Попередній заголовок рівня &3"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the next level-3 heading in the document.
#. TRANSLATORS: Name of this keyboard-shortcut action, shown in the Customize Keyboard Shortcuts dialog (its list of assignable actions, and the "Set Shortcut for {}" / conflict-reassignment prompts).
msgid "Next Heading Level 3"
msgstr "Наступний заголовок рівня 3"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the previous level-4 heading in the document.
msgid "Previous Heading Level &4"
msgstr "Попередній заголовок рівня &4"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the next level-4 heading in the document.
#. TRANSLATORS: Name of this keyboard-shortcut action, shown in the Customize Keyboard Shortcuts dialog (its list of assignable actions, and the "Set Shortcut for {}" / conflict-reassignment prompts).
msgid "Next Heading Level 4"
msgstr "Наступний заголовок рівня 4"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the previous level-5 heading in the document.
msgid "Previous Heading Level &5"
msgstr "Попередній заголовок рівня &5"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the next level-5 heading in the document.
#. TRANSLATORS: Name of this keyboard-shortcut action, shown in the Customize Keyboard Shortcuts dialog (its list of assignable actions, and the "Set Shortcut for {}" / conflict-reassignment prompts).
msgid "Next Heading Level 5"
msgstr "Наступний заголовок рівня 5"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the previous level-6 heading in the document.
msgid "Previous Heading Level &6"
msgstr "Попередній заголовок рівня &6"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the next level-6 heading in the document.
#. TRANSLATORS: Name of this keyboard-shortcut action, shown in the Customize Keyboard Shortcuts dialog (its list of assignable actions, and the "Set Shortcut for {}" / conflict-reassignment prompts).
msgid "Next Heading Level 6"
msgstr "Наступний заголовок рівня 6"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the previous page.
msgid "Previous Pa&ge"
msgstr "&Попередня Сторінка"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the next page.
msgid "Next Pag&e"
msgstr "&Наступна Сторінка"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the previous link in the document.
msgid "Previous Lin&k"
msgstr "&Попереднє посилання"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the next link in the document.
msgid "Next Lin&k"
msgstr "&Наступне посилання"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the previous image in the document.
msgid "Previous Ima&ge"
msgstr "&Попереднє зображення"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the next image in the document.
msgid "Next Ima&ge"
msgstr "&Наступне зображення"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the previous figure in the document.
msgid "Previous Figu&re"
msgstr "&Попередній малюнок"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the next figure in the document.
msgid "Next Figu&re"
msgstr "&Наступний малюнок"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the previous table in the document.
msgid "Previous &Table"
msgstr "&Попередня таблиця"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the next table in the document.
msgid "Next &Table"
msgstr "&Наступна таблиця"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the previous formula.
msgid "Previous For&mula"
msgstr "&Попередня формула"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the next formula.
msgid "Next For&mula"
msgstr "&Наступна формула"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the previous separator (e.g. a horizontal rule) in the document.
msgid "Previous Se&parator"
msgstr "&Попередній роздільник"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the next separator (e.g. a horizontal rule) in the document.
msgid "Next Se&parator"
msgstr "&Наступний роздільник"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the previous list in the document.
msgid "Previous L&ist"
msgstr "&Попередній список"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the next list in the document.
msgid "Next L&ist"
msgstr "&Наступний список"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the previous item within the current list.
msgid "Previous List &Item"
msgstr "&Попередній елемент списку"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the next item within the current list.
msgid "Next List I&tem"
msgstr "&Наступний елемент списку"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move back to the previous position in navigation history.
msgid "Go &Back"
msgstr "Перейти &назад"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move forward to the next position in navigation history.
msgid "Go &Forward"
msgstr "Перейти &вперед"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the start of the current list or table.
msgid "Container &Start"
msgstr "На &початок контейнера"

#. TRANSLATORS: Status-bar help text for the Go > Container Start menu item.
msgid "Go to the start of the current list or table"
msgstr "Перейти до початку поточного списку або таблиці"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move past the end of the current list or table.
msgid "Past Container &End"
msgstr "За нижню &межу контейнера"

#. TRANSLATORS: Status-bar help text for the Go > Past Container End menu item.
msgid "Go past the end of the current list or table"
msgstr "Перейти за кінець поточного списку або таблиці"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the previous bookmark in the document.
msgid "&Previous Bookmark"
msgstr "&Попередня закладка"

#. TRANSLATORS: Status-bar help text for the Go > Previous Bookmark menu item.
msgid "Go to previous bookmark"
msgstr "Перейти до попередньої закладки"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the next bookmark in the document.
msgid "&Next Bookmark"
msgstr "&Наступна закладка"

#. TRANSLATORS: Status-bar help text for the Go > Next Bookmark menu item.
msgid "Go to next bookmark"
msgstr "Перейти до наступної закладки"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the previous note in the document.
msgid "Previous &Note"
msgstr "&Попередня нотатка"

#. TRANSLATORS: Status-bar help text for the Go > Previous Note menu item.
msgid "Go to previous note"
msgstr "Перейти до попередньої нотатки"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to move to the next note in the document.
msgid "Next N&ote"
msgstr "&Наступна нотатка"

#. TRANSLATORS: Status-bar help text for the Go > Next Note menu item.
msgid "Go to next note"
msgstr "Перейти до наступної нотатки"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to open a dialog listing all bookmarks and notes.
msgid "Jump to &All..."
msgstr "Перейти до &всіх..."

#. TRANSLATORS: Status-bar help text for the Go > Jump to All menu item.
msgid "Show all bookmarks and notes"
msgstr "Показати всі закладки та нотатки"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to open a dialog listing only bookmarks.
msgid "Jump to &Bookmarks Only..."
msgstr "Перейти лише до &закладок..."

#. TRANSLATORS: Status-bar help text for the Go > Jump to Bookmarks Only menu item.
msgid "Show bookmarks only"
msgstr "Показати лише закладки"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to open a dialog listing only notes.
msgid "Jump to Notes &Only..."
msgstr "Перейти лише до &нотаток..."

#. TRANSLATORS: Status-bar help text for the Go > Jump to Notes Only menu item.
msgid "Show notes only"
msgstr "Показати лише нотатки"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Go menu to view the text of the note at the current reading position.
msgid "&View Note Text"
msgstr "Переглянути &текст нотатки"

#. TRANSLATORS: Status-bar help text for the Go > View Note Text menu item.
msgid "View the note at current position"
msgstr "Переглянути нотатку в поточній позиції"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Tools menu to add or remove a bookmark at the current reading position.
msgid "Toggle &Bookmark"
msgstr "Додати/видалити &закладку"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Tools menu to add a bookmark with an attached note at the current reading position.
msgid "Bookmark with &Note"
msgstr "Закладка з &нотаткою"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Tools menu to mark the current position as the beginning of a selection to copy from later.
msgid "Set Selection St&art"
msgstr "Встановити &початок виділення"

#. TRANSLATORS: Status-bar help text for the Tools > Set Selection Start menu item.
msgid "Mark the beginning of a selection to copy from"
msgstr "Позначити початок виділення для копіювання"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Tools menu to copy everything from the marked beginning of a selection to the current position.
msgid "&Copy from Selection Start"
msgstr "&Копіювати від початку виділення"

#. TRANSLATORS: Status-bar help text for the Tools > Copy from Selection Start menu item.
msgid "Copy from the beginning of the selection to here"
msgstr "Скопіювати від початку виділеного фрагмента до цього місця"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Tools > Select and copy submenu to go back to the marked beginning of the selection.
msgid "&Jump to Selection Start"
msgstr "&Перейти до початку виділення"

#. TRANSLATORS: Status-bar help text for the Tools > Select and copy > Jump to Selection Start menu item.
msgid "Go back to the beginning of the selection"
msgstr "Повернутися до початку виділення"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Tools menu to play or pause the document's audio narration.
msgid "&Play/Pause Audio"
msgstr "&Відтворити/Призупинити аудіо"

#. TRANSLATORS: Status-bar help text for the Play/Pause Audio menu item.
msgid "Play or pause this document's audio narration"
msgstr "Відтворити або призупинити аудіосупровід цього документа"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Tools menu to skip the audio narration forward.
msgid "Seek Audio &Forward"
msgstr "Перемотати &вперед"

#. TRANSLATORS: Status-bar help text for the Seek Audio Forward menu item.
msgid "Skip the audio narration forward"
msgstr "Перемотати аудіо вперед"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Tools menu to skip the audio narration backward.
msgid "Seek Audio &Backward"
msgstr "Перемотати &назад"

#. TRANSLATORS: Status-bar help text for the Seek Audio Backward menu item.
msgid "Skip the audio narration backward"
msgstr "Перемотати аудіо назад"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Tools menu to increase the amount of time each audio seek skips.
msgid "&Increase Audio Seek Amount"
msgstr "&Збільшити крок перемотування аудіо"

#. TRANSLATORS: Status-bar help text for the Increase Audio Seek Amount menu item.
msgid "Increase how far seeking the audio narration moves"
msgstr "Збільшити інтервал перемотування аудіо"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Tools menu to decrease the amount of time each audio seek skips.
msgid "&Decrease Audio Seek Amount"
msgstr "З&меншити крок перемотування аудіо"

#. TRANSLATORS: Status-bar help text for the Decrease Audio Seek Amount menu item.
msgid "Decrease how far seeking the audio narration moves"
msgstr "Зменшити інтервал перемотування аудіо"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Tools menu to increase the audio narration's playback speed.
msgid "&Increase Audio Speed"
msgstr "&Збільшити швидкість відтворення аудіо"

#. TRANSLATORS: Status-bar help text for the Increase Audio Speed menu item.
msgid "Increase how fast the audio narration plays"
msgstr "Збільшити швидкість відтворення аудіозапису"

#. TRANSLATORS: Menu item in the Tools menu to decrease the audio narration's playback speed.
msgid "&Decrease Audio Speed"
msgstr "&Зменшити швидкість відтворення аудіо"

